sequenceDiagram
Sales->>CRM: Request proposal from approved estimate
CRM->>Estimating: Retrieve approved scenario
Estimating-->>CRM: Scope, quantities, price, assumptions
CRM->>Approval: Evaluate commercial thresholds
Approval-->>CRM: Approved
CRM->>Document: Generate branded proposal version
CRM->>Customer: Issue proposal
Customer->>Signature: Review and sign
Signature-->>CRM: Evidence and completed artifact
CRM->>ProjectOps: Create award handoff
